{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-catalogo-gen",
  "category": "isp",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-catalogo-gen&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "description": "Catálogo CRUD genérico ISP con controller JSON.",
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-catalogo-gen",
  "hasBehavior": true,
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": [
        "Catálogo CRUD (port ISP <code class=\"code\">CatalogoGen</code>). El <code class=\"code\">controller</code>",
        "          se genera con <code class=\"code\">createCatalogController(json)</code>: listado, columnas y",
        "          acciones (crear / modificar / visualizar / verificar / duplicar / recodificar / eliminar / consolidar)."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "callout",
          "html": [
            "Selecciona una fila: la toolbar habilita acciones que requieren selección",
            "          <strong>sin parpadear</strong> (el grid pinta la selección in-place).",
            "          En demos se usa <code class=\"code\">mock</code>; en producción pasa <code class=\"code\">server</code> + <code class=\"code\">endpoints</code>."
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-catalogo-gen id=\"catDemo\" style=\"height: 30rem;\"></iswc-catalogo-gen>",
            "          <p id=\"catLog\">Última acción: <code class=\"code\">—</code></p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "config",
      "title": "JSON de configuración",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Campo",
            "Notas"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>entrie</code>",
              "Nombre singular del recurso (títulos)"
            ],
            [
              "<code>primaryKeys</code>",
              "PK(s) del registro"
            ],
            [
              "<code>columns</code>",
              "Defs de grilla <code>{ field, header }</code>"
            ],
            [
              "<code>actions</code>",
              "<code>true</code> (todas) · lista · <code>false</code>"
            ],
            [
              "<code>mock</code>",
              "Array en memoria (demos / offline)"
            ],
            [
              "<code>server.local / remote</code>",
              "Host/port/https como TInfoConnection"
            ],
            [
              "<code>endpoints.recurso</code>",
              "→ <code>/api/{recurso}</code>; plural auto o <code>recursos</code>"
            ],
            [
              "<code>token</code>",
              "string o <code>() => string</code> (Bearer)"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ficha": {
    "sections": {
      "anatomia": {
        "content": [
          "Catálogo CRUD (port ISP <code class=\"code\">CatalogoGen</code>). El <code class=\"code\">controller</code>",
          "          se genera con <code class=\"code\">createCatalogController(json)</code>: listado, columnas y",
          "          acciones (crear / modificar / visualizar / verificar / duplicar / recodificar / eliminar / consolidar)."
        ]
      },
      "ejemplos": {
        "content": [
          "```js",
          "import { createCatalogController } from './isp/controller-from-config.min.js';",
          "",
          "cat.controller = createCatalogController({",
          "  entrie: 'Curso',",
          "  primaryKeys: ['icurso'],",
          "  columns: [",
          "    { field: 'icurso', header: 'Código' },",
          "    { field: 'ncurso', header: 'Nombre' },",
          "  ],",
          "  // actions: true  → todas (default)",
          "  // actions: ['crear','modificar','eliminar']",
          "  mock: [",
          "    { icurso: 'C001', ncurso: 'Contabilidad básica' },",
          "  ],",
          "  // server: {",
          "  //   useLocal: false,",
          "  //   local:  { host: 'localhost', port: <SERVER_PORT>, https: false },",
          "  //   remote: { host: '….azurewebsites.net', port: 443, https: true },",
          "  // },",
          "  // endpoints: { recurso: 'curso', recursos: 'cursos' },",
          "  // token: () => sessionStorage.getItem('token'),",
          "});",
          "```"
        ]
      }
    },
    "exclude": [
      "apiJs",
      "atributos",
      "eventos",
      "parts",
      "props",
      "slots",
      "states"
    ]
  }
}